[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8160.47, "timestamp": "02:16:00", "text": "某物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8162.31, "timestamp": "02:16:02", "text": "是的。至于印地语，我当时想的是：“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8164.709, "timestamp": "02:16:04", "text": "“这玩意儿真搞笑。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8166.47, "timestamp": "02:16:06", "text": "我越意识到我喜欢那种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8168.069, "timestamp": "02:16:08", "text": "那，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8171.27, "timestamp": "02:16:11", "text": "兄弟。真是太烦人了，因为他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8173.589, "timestamp": "02:16:13", "text": "他们当时正在做那件事，对吧，就在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8177.35, "timestamp": "02:16:17", "text": "漫威电影宇宙（MCU）引入的那个东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8179.27, "timestamp": "02:16:19", "text": "客串角色，他们会说：“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8181.91, "timestamp": "02:16:21", "text": "你认识这个角色吧？对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.189, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "滚开。我讨厌那个节目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8191.669, "timestamp": "02:16:31", "text": "那玩意儿又给了我一个讨厌它的理由。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8195.429, "timestamp": "02:16:35", "text": "节目很精彩，蜘蛛侠为之牺牲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8197.19, "timestamp": "02:16:37", "text": "就是那个节目，兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8199.27, "timestamp": "02:16:39", "text": "就像他们取消了精彩的演出一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8202.709, "timestamp": "02:16:42", "text": "那。是的。那只山羊真是太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8205.389, "timestamp": "02:16:45", "text": "就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.27, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "山羊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8214.91, "timestamp": "02:16:54", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8219.99, "timestamp": "02:16:59", "text": "真是太壮观了。"}]